<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>手机壳类目行业分析看板</title>
    <script src="/static/js/echarts.min.js"></script>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg: #0f1420;
            --panel: #161d2d;
            --panel2: #1b2437;
            --line: #26314a;
            --txt: #e6ebf5;
            --sub: #8c9ab2;
            --acc: #4f8cff;
            --acc2: #22c58b;
            --warn: #ffb020;
            --pink: #ff6b9d;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0
        }

        body {
            background: linear-gradient(160deg, #0c1018, #111827 60%, #0c1018);
            color: var(--txt);
            font-family: "WenQuanYi Micro Hei", "Microsoft YaHei", system-ui, sans-serif;
            padding: 28px 20px 60px
        }

        .wrap {
            max-width: 1240px;
            margin: 0 auto
        }

        header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-end;
            gap: 14px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-bottom: 6px
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 26px;
            letter-spacing: .5px
        }

        .tag {
            color: var(--sub);
            font-size: 13px;
            padding: 3px 10px;
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 20px
        }

        .desc {
            color: var(--sub);
            font-size: 13.5px;
            margin: 8px 0 24px;
            line-height: 1.7
        }

        .desc b {
            color: var(--txt)
        }

        .kpis {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(168px, 1fr));
            gap: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 26px
        }

        .kpi {
            background: var(--panel);
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 16px 18px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden
        }

        .kpi::before {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            top: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            width: 3px;
            background: var(--acc)
        }

        .kpi.g::before {
            background: var(--acc2)
        }

        .kpi.o::before {
            background: var(--warn)
        }

        .kpi.p::before {
            background: var(--pink)
        }

        .kpi .k {
            color: var(--sub);
            font-size: 12.5px;
            margin-bottom: 7px
        }

        .kpi .v {
            font-size: 23px;
            font-weight: 700
        }

        .kpi .u {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--sub);
            margin-left: 3px;
            font-weight: 400
        }

        .kpi .n {
            color: var(--sub);
            font-size: 11.5px;
            margin-top: 5px
        }

        section {
            background: var(--panel);
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 20px 20px 12px;
            margin-bottom: 22px
        }

        .h {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 4px
        }

        .h i {
            width: 4px;
            height: 17px;
            background: var(--acc);
            border-radius: 2px
        }

        .h h2 {
            font-size: 17px
        }

        .sub {
            color: var(--sub);
            font-size: 12.5px;
            margin: 2px 0 14px 14px
        }

        .chart {
            width: 100%;
            height: 400px
        }

        .chart.tall {
            height: 520px
        }

        .chart.short {
            height: 340px
        }

        .twocol {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
            gap: 16px
        }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .twocol {
                grid-template-columns:1fr
            }
        }

        .note {
            color: var(--sub);
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 1.75;
            margin: 10px 2px 4px
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 13px;
            margin-top: 8px
        }

        th, td {
            padding: 9px 8px;
            text-align: right;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
            white-space: nowrap
        }

        th:first-child, td:first-child {
            text-align: left
        }

        th {
            color: var(--sub);
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 12px;
            cursor: pointer;
            user-select: none;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            background: var(--panel)
        }

        th:hover {
            color: var(--acc)
        }

        tbody tr:hover {
            background: var(--panel2)
        }

        .bar {
            display: inline-block;
            height: 6px;
            border-radius: 3px;
            vertical-align: middle;
            margin-left: 6px;
            background: var(--acc);
            opacity: .8
        }

        .scroll {
            max-height: 480px;
            overflow: auto;
            border-radius: 10px
        }

        footer {
            color: var(--sub);
            font-size: 12px;
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 30px;
            line-height: 1.8
        }

        .hl {
            color: var(--warn)
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
    <header>
        <h1>手机壳类目行业分析看板</h1>
        <span class="tag">行业洞察</span>
        <span class="tag">样本 171 款</span>
        <span class="tag">63 个品牌</span>
    </header>
    <p class="desc">
        数据覆盖 <b>171 款</b>样本、<b>63 个品牌</b>。看板从
        <b>价格带分布</b>、<b>品牌集中度</b>、<b>上架时间分布</b>三个维度刻画竞争格局与供给节奏，点击表头可排序，图表支持悬停查看明细。
    </p>

    <div class="kpis">
        <div class="kpi">
            <div class="k">样本商品数</div>
            <div class="v">171<span class="u">款</span></div>
            <div class="n">覆盖全部价格档位</div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi g">
            <div class="k">月销总量</div>
            <div class="v">1,918,147</div>
            <div class="n">全样本合计</div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi g">
            <div class="k">月GMV</div>
            <div class="v">$31,964,826</div>
            <div class="n">客单价加权</div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi o">
            <div class="k">5–25美元占比</div>
            <div class="v">77.2<span class="u">%</span></div>
            <div class="n">核心价格带商品</div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi p">
            <div class="k">TOP5 销量份额</div>
            <div class="v">57.8<span class="u">%</span></div>
            <div class="n">品牌高度集中</div>
        </div>
        <div class="kpi p">
            <div class="k">TOP5 GMV 份额</div>
            <div class="v">61.7<span class="u">%</span></div>
            <div class="n">头部更赚钱</div>
        </div>
